WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.461
Let's swap the snare for a clap, without touching the pattern. Press A, Shift Main, then pad two.

2
00:00:06.523 --> 00:00:16.290
Shift Menu opens Browse. Shift and pad ten shows Samples; Shift and pad five opens Search. Enter NEW and confirm with pad fourteen.

3
00:00:16.290 --> 00:00:21.890
Hold Shift and pad thirteen to select the first sample in this prepared library: the tutorial clap.

4
00:00:21.890 --> 00:00:26.345
Shift and Play auditions it. You can check the sound before assigning it to the pad.

5
00:00:26.345 --> 00:00:32.538
Pad two selects the snare as our load target. Press the dial to load the clap. Its notes stay where they were.

6
00:00:32.538 --> 00:00:39.923
Back to Main and pad thirteen. Hear how the new backbeat changes the groove. Stop when you're done; Undo can restore the snare.
